VENDORED SOURCE CODE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/md5.ts contains the MD5 implementation from the Deno standard library,
copied in full and modified only in formatting, in the exported wrapper, and in
narrowing one parameter type. MD5 has no Web Crypto equivalent, so a userland
implementation is required for browser support.

Source: deno_std 0.160.0, hash/md5.ts
        https://deno.land/std@0.160.0/hash/md5.ts

